            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[### Added
- **Droid and Devin conversations on your phone.** Tap a Droid or Devin
  session on your iPhone to read its history (your prompts, the agent's
  replies and the tools it ran) and see new messages as they arrive. A
  Devin conversation picks up where Devin compacted it, so earlier work
  stays in view.
- Groundwork for the next iPhone update.
]]></description>
